  "title": "Loaded Potato Soup I",
  "description": "A soup to make you happy. Milk, sour cream, butter, and cheddar cheese make this soup very thick and creamy, and by microwaving the potatoes, you can whip it up in minutes.",
  "authors": [
    "Claire"
  ],
